    expect "G:alpha G25 G3588 H559 (3 Greek, 1 Hebrew); Greek 2 new · 1 to review; Hebrew 1 to review\n0 4 5 \nMemoryTo review: 2 Greek words\nMemoryTo review: Psalm 23\nMemoryTo review: Psalm 23, 2 Greek words and 1 Hebrew word\n"
}

